# Defense-in-depth: never publish internal docs.
# The package.json "files" allowlist is the primary control (explicit per-file
# entries under docs/). This .npmignore is a second guard so that if a glob is
# ever re-introduced, these internal doc patterns still get excluded.

docs/*-plan.md
docs/*-compliance.md
docs/security-audit-report.md
docs/research-synthesis*.md
docs/mega-*.md
docs/chrome-brain-*.md
